<%#
    Who makes this, how to reach him, and the two ways to say thanks.

    The apps say the same thing on their own About screens, and this page exists
    so that web users — who have no store listing, no "rate this app" prompt and
    no reason to know there is a person on the other end — get the same answer.

    Paired with and without a budget for the same reason as HowItWorks: the app
    bar's "Done" has to know where it goes back to.
%>
<%- include('partials/head') %>
            <div class="appbar__titles">
                <h1 class="appbar__title"><a href="<%= budget ? '/Budget/' + budget.UniqueId : '/' %>">About</a></h1>
                <% if (budget) { %><span class="appbar__sub"><%= budget.Name || "Weekly Budget" %></span><% } %>
            </div>
            <div class="appbar__actions">
                <a class="btn btn--text" href="<%= budget ? '/Budget/' + budget.UniqueId : '/' %>">Done</a>
            </div>
<%- include('partials/afterbar') %>
<article class="prose">
    <span class="prose__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 12c2.21 0 4-1.79 4-4s-1.79-4-4-4-4 1.79-4 4 1.79 4 4 4zm0 2c-2.67 0-8 1.34-8 4v2h16v-2c0-2.66-5.33-4-8-4z"/></svg></span>
    <h2>Who makes this</h2>
    <p>I'm Andrew — just a guy in Calgary who loves making software and thinks
       more of it should be free. Weekly Budget has no ads, no accounts and no
       price, and it is not going to grow any. I build it because I use it every
       week myself.</p>

    <span class="prose__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 4H4c-1.1 0-1.99.9-1.99 2L2 18c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2V6c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2zm0 4-8 5-8-5V6l8 5 8-5v2z"/></svg></span>
    <h2>Need help? Email me</h2>
    <p>If something is broken, or you want it to do something it doesn't, write
       to <a href="mailto:avens19@gmail.com?subject=Weekly%20Budget%20on%20the%20web">avens19@gmail.com</a>.
       There is no support desk and no ticket queue — it is just me, and I read
       all of it.</p>

    <span class="prose__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 17.27 18.18 21l-1.64-7.03L22 9.24l-7.19-.61L12 2 9.19 8.63 2 9.24l5.46 4.73L5.82 21z"/></svg></span>
    <h2>Leave a review</h2>
    <p>Nothing here is advertised, so a review in one of the stores is most of
       how anyone new finds it.</p>
<%- include('partials/appLinks', { review: true }) %>

    <span class="prose__icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 3H4v10c0 2.21 1.79 4 4 4h6c2.21 0 4-1.79 4-4v-3h2c1.11 0 2-.9 2-2V5c0-1.11-.89-2-2-2zm0 5h-2V5h2v3zM4 19h16v2H4z"/></svg></span>
    <h2>Buy me a coffee</h2>
    <p>If it has saved you an argument about money,
       <a href="https://buymeacoffee.com/ovens">buymeacoffee.com/ovens</a> is
       there. Entirely optional — the app is free either way, and it stays free
       whether anyone uses that link or not.</p>

    <p><a href="<%= budget ? '/Budget/' + budget.UniqueId + '/HowItWorks' : '/HowItWorks' %>">How this works</a>
       &middot;
       <a href="<%= budget ? '/Budget/' + budget.UniqueId + '/Apps' : '/Apps' %>">Apps</a>
       &middot;
       <a href="/privacy">Privacy</a></p>
</article>
<% if (budget) { %>
<%- include('partials/bottomnav', { budget: budget }) %>
<% } else { %>
<%- include('partials/beforenav') %>
<% } %>
<%- include('partials/scripts') %>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
